    "Final verified ANNUAL taxable base after lawful deductions/exemptions, but BEFORE any zero-rate tariff band. HN full eligible40,000deduction already included. PY base<=verified liable receipts; exempt aguinaldo not in those receipts. EC personal expenses are a separate post-tax rebate, not another base deduction. Eligibility must be independently checked.",
